<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"></div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2013300744/device-tp.jpg" title="Qantas" alt="Qantas" style="width: 680px; height: 70px;"></font></a></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2023251803/eDM_680x400.png" title="Qantas Business Rewards" alt="Qantas Business Rewards" width="680" height="400" style="width: 680px; height: 400px;"></font></td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-align: left; height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Enjoy a business bonus of 500 Qantas Points</font></h3></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},<br><br>With the end of financial year approaching, we’d like to reward your business with&nbsp;<b>500 bonus Qantas Points</b>&nbsp;when you travel on eligible Qantas flights*.<br><br>Register and book eligible Qantas flights from&nbsp;<b>30 April 2018 - 8 May 2018</b>&nbsp;for travel by&nbsp;<b>30 June 2018</b>&nbsp;and enjoy 500 bonus Qantas Points for the business for each eligible flight.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To ensure you receive Qantas Points for your business and for the person travelling<sup style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 11px;">~</sup>, remember to add your business' ABN and traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer number to every flight booking.<br></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 0px; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/QANTAS-EOFY-500BONUS" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/QANTAS-EOFY-500BONUS" target="_blank" alt="Register today" title="Register today" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; line-height: 16px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Register today</font></a></td><td width="6" align="left" valign="top" style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 0px; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/QANTAS-EOFY-500BONUS" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543099/qa_primary_cta_r.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 45px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 10px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 23px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 23px; margin: 0px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Important information</font></h3></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 15px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 15px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">* Qantas Business Rewards members must (a) register their ABN and (b) book an eligible Qantas flight between 12.01am (AEST) 30 April 2018 and 11.59pm (AEST) 8 May 2018 for travel until 11.59pm (AEST) 30 June 2018. An Eligible Flight means a domestic or international flight which has a Qantas 'QF' flight number on the ticket that is purchased in Australia; is operated by Qantas, Emirates or American Airlines; has a ticket number commencing with '081'; and is booked and travelled for business on or after the date the business registers for Qantas Business Rewards.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#definationAirline" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Exclusions apply</a>. A business that has a Corporate Airfares or rebate agreement with Qantas; or is a travel agent, travel wholesaler, travel consolidator or other seller or re-seller of air travel, is not eligible for this offer. This offer cannot be used in conjunction with any other bonus offer by Qantas. Only one bonus Qantas Points offer can be used per individual qualifying segment of your itinerary. If you qualify for multiple offers, the offer with the maximum bonus points will be applied to each individual qualifying segment. The bonus Qantas Points may take up to 8 weeks after travel has been completed on each Eligible Flight to be credited to your business' account. Qantas Points are offered under&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#airlineterms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas' Terms and Conditions</a>. Eligibility conditions apply. A one-off join fee of $89.50 usually applies however this will be waived for any business that joins by 8 May 2018. Qantas Points for business are offered under the Qantas' Terms and Conditions and earning thresholds apply. Qantas Points earned on air travel are determined in accordance with the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/airlineearntable" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">airline earn table</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><sup style="line-height: 11px; font-size: 9px; position: relative;">~</sup>&nbsp;Qantas Points for business are offered under&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#airlineterms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas' Terms and Conditions</a>&nbsp;and earning thresholds apply. Qantas Points earned from air travel are determined in accordance with the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/airlineearntable" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earn Table</a>. A member's ABN and traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number must be quoted at the time of booking to earn Qantas Points for both the business and the traveller.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; line-height: 13px; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); text-align: justify; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br><br><br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>